From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:59:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132: Add the video decoder and its DART

The AVD driver matches apple,t8132-avd (its T8132 variant loads
apple/avd-fw-v5-t1.bin), but no T8132 device tree describes the decoder.

Add it and its DART, disabled, from the J604 ADT (avd-version 4):
- /arm-io/avd: the block at 0x3_a0000000, 0x1404000, interrupts 948 and
  949; the code, SRAM, mailbox and control windows at the offsets T604x
  uses for the T8132 register family (t604x.dtsi), 0x1080000, 0x1094000,
  0x10a8000 and 0x1100000. The 0x14000 code window holds the 0x12000 v5-t1
  firmware, which the driver copies without a bounds check.
- /arm-io/dart-avd: dart,t8110 at 0x3_a1020000, 0x20000, interrupt 955;
  the decoder is stream 0 (mapper-avd, reg 0).
- power and reset: AVD_SYS, PMGR device 0x9d, the ps_avd_sys record at
  0x580. Its ADT parent (AFISOCNI2) has no power-state register, and the
  AVD-SYS-V, AVD-SOC-VNOM and AVD-SOC-VMAX gates are virtual.

No board enables them here.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
index 86fba79ac9..7513076ee8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
@@ -1411,6 +1411,40 @@
 			iommus = <&aop_dart 8>;
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
+
+		/*
+		 * Video decoder. The ADT gives the whole block (/arm-io/avd,
+		 * 0x3_a0000000, 0x1404000; interrupts 948 and 949); the
+		 * windows are those of the T8132 register family as T604x
+		 * describes them, with the CM3 SRAM between its code and the
+		 * mailbox. The decoder is stream 0 (mapper-avd) of its DART.
+		 */
+		avd: avd@3a1080000 {
+			compatible = "apple,t8132-avd";
+			reg = <0x3 0xa1080000 0x0 0x14000>,
+			      <0x3 0xa1094000 0x0 0x14000>,
+			      <0x3 0xa10a8000 0x0 0x4000>,
+			      <0x3 0xa1100000 0x0 0x10000>;
+			reg-names = "code", "sram", "mbox", "ctrl";
+			interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
+			interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 948 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+				     <AIC_IRQ 949 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			power-domains = <&ps_avd_sys>;
+			resets = <&ps_avd_sys>;
+			iommus = <&avd_dart 0>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
+		/* ADT /arm-io/dart-avd: dart,t8110, interrupt 955 */
+		avd_dart: iommu@3a1020000 {
+			compatible = "apple,t8132-dart", "apple,t8110-dart";
+			reg = <0x3 0xa1020000 0x0 0x20000>;
+			#iommu-cells = <1>;
+			interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
+			interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 955 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			power-domains = <&ps_avd_sys>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
 	};
 
 	timer {
